p is "/var-path"
api is a web server
    port is 18748
.
admin is a web server
    port is 18749
.
when api receives GET at p
    respond with "variable path"
.
when nobody receives GET at "/undeclared-server"
    respond with "server name ignored"
.
when admin receives GET at "/admin"
    respond with "admin route on api port"
.
